# Allow-list: only what the image build reads is sent to the builder (smaller, faster and no accidental secrets).
**
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!.npmrc
!global.json
!Directory.Build.props
!NuGet.Config
!client
!contracts
!tests/contract-stubs
!server

# Exclusions inside the allowed folders (later rules win).
**/node_modules
**/bin
**/obj
client/dist
client/test-results
client/playwright-report
server/.env
server/.env.*
server/appsettings.Local.json
**/.DS_Store
